634 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (AI algorithms make use of fuzzy logic. In fuzzy logic, there is no logic for the absolute truth and absolute false value. But in fuzzy logic, there is an intermediate value too present which is partially true and partially false.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [10]
>>
